window.BUILDS=[{"n":1,"slug":"atelier-voss","kind":"site","lane":"quiet","trade":"Architecture practice","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Quiet","name":"Atelier Voss","biz":"Architecture practice","c":"#2B59FF","sheet":"#E1E8FF","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2B59FF","short":"An architect's portfolio where every building sits beside a drawing that draws itself.","long":"Atelier Voss opens on a finished house with the practice name across it. Pick a building in the index and its photo fills the screen while its drawing draws itself on a sheet. Halvard House is then told slowly, with numbered spots lighting up on photo and plan together, and the enquiry is the practice's own title block.","proves":"Real photography and technical drawing on the same page, so a visitor sees both the finished building and the thinking behind it.","tags":["Finished buildings, full bleed","Drawings that draw themselves","An enquiry set out as a title block"],"tk":"creative","show":[{"tap":".pr[data-p=barn]","say":"Pick a building and its photo fills the screen"},{"wait":1600,"say":"Its drawing draws itself on the sheet"},{"scroll":"#halvard","say":"Halvard House pins in place and the plan draws as you scroll"},{"tap":".keys button[data-n=\"3\"]","say":"Tap a number and it lights up on the photo and the plan"}]},{"n":2,"slug":"cadence","kind":"site","lane":"direct","trade":"Software company","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Direct","name":"Cadence","biz":"Field-ops software","c":"#22D3EE","sheet":"#E0F9FD","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#1B7A89","short":"Route and shift software that prices every late job and lets your coordinator make the call.","long":"Cadence opens on its own live board. Scroll and the clock ticks to 07:40, a job slips behind a crash and the board proposes a crew swap you take or leave. Then three features cut from the real screens, a pricing statement that does the maths and a walkthrough booking.","proves":"Software can be sold by letting people use it on the first screen.","tags":["The live board is the first screen","The 07:40 slip, priced in pounds","Pricing as a monthly statement"],"tk":"software","show":[{"wait":1200,"say":"The live board is the first screen"},{"tap":"#syncBtn","say":"At 07:40 a job slips behind a crash and the board prices it","pause":3400},{"tap":"#takeSwap","say":"Take the swap: it lands in the window and saves £5,800"},{"tap":"#regUp","say":"Priced on jobs, not seats. The statement does the maths"}]},{"n":3,"slug":"maree","kind":"site","lane":"motion","trade":"Fragrance house","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Motion","name":"Marée","biz":"Fragrance house","c":"#A9CBBD","sheet":"#F3F8F6","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#63756F","short":"Eleven hours on skin, drawn as five tides, from a one-scent house in Saint-Malo.","long":"Marée sells one mineral extrait, so the page behaves like the sea it comes from. Drag through a day on skin and each note rises over its own photograph as it leads. Pick a size and the bag says when it is filled and when it arrives.","proves":"A luxury brand can feel expensive and still get the bottle into the bag in two taps.","tags":["Real photographs of the bottle and the notes","A tide chart for a day on skin","A bag that gives fill and arrival dates"],"tk":"creative","show":[{"scroll":"#clock","say":"Eleven hours on skin, drawn as five tides"},{"tap":"#jumps button[data-h=\"10.5\"]","say":"Late in the day, birch tar leads and the salt stays"},{"tap":".size[data-s=\"100\"]","say":"Pick a size"},{"tap":"#addBtn","say":"The bag knows when it is filled and when it arrives"}]},{"n":4,"slug":"signal","kind":"site","lane":"loud","trade":"Festival","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Loud","name":"SIGNAL 2027","biz":"Music & light festival","c":"#3B18E0","sheet":"#E4DFFB","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#3B18E0","short":"A festival website where the line-up poster builds your weekend and warns you about clashes.","long":"Signal opens on the stage film with the festival name set edge to edge. The line-up is a printed poster: tap the acts you want and it stamps any clash, while the slip underneath draws your nights hour by hour. Tickets show the booking fee before you hold them.","proves":"Bold, and still easy to use.","tags":["A stage film toned in two inks","A line-up poster that checks for clashes","The booking fee shown before you hold"],"tk":"creative","show":[{"scroll":"#lineup","say":"The line-up is a printed poster you can tap"},{"tap":".act[data-i=\"0\"]","say":"Tap an act to add it to your weekend"},{"tap":".act[data-i=\"2\"]","say":"Pick two that overlap and the poster stamps the clash"},{"scroll":"#plan","say":"The slip underneath draws your night with the overlap marked"}]},{"n":5,"slug":"long-exposure","kind":"site","lane":"motion","trade":"Film production company","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Motion","name":"Long Exposure","biz":"Film production, Manchester","c":"#E5322D","sheet":"#FBE2E2","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#D02F2B","short":"A showreel website that plays your best work first and turns viewers into booked shoots.","long":"Long Exposure's reel fills the first screen with a running timecode, and the scrub bar is made of the four jobs: tap one and the reel cuts to it. Below, the work index plays each job full screen as you point at it, and the call sheet request starts with the six things they shoot.","proves":"A film company's site can open on the film, and still take the enquiry.","tags":["The showreel is the first screen","A scrub bar made of the jobs","A call sheet instead of a contact form"],"tk":"creative","show":[{"wait":2400,"say":"The showreel fills the first screen, timecode running"},{"tap":"#segs .seg:nth-child(3) em","say":"Tap a job on the scrub bar and the reel cuts to it"},{"tap":".row[data-k=proof]","say":"Point at a job and it plays full screen"},{"tap":".job[data-k=brand]","say":"The services are the first line of the call sheet"}]},{"n":6,"slug":"overhead","kind":"site","lane":"motion","trade":"Drone survey & filming","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Motion","name":"Overhead","biz":"Drone survey, Peak District","c":"#FF6A13","sheet":"#FFEADE","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#BF5314","short":"A drone survey website where each service is a survey you watch draw itself.","long":"Overhead's homepage flies straight down over a Peak District field with live telemetry. Scroll on and a pinned aerial photo draws each survey in turn, roof defects, cut and spoil, contours and a film circuit, with the price beside it. The quote form starts with the postcode and gives back a job reference.","proves":"A survey firm can show what it hands over, not just a gallery of aerial photos.","tags":["A straight-down flight with live telemetry","A survey that draws itself as you scroll","Postcode first, job reference back"],"tk":"creative","show":[{"scroll":"#survey","say":"The survey draws itself as you scroll"},{"tap":"#t-site","say":"Each service is its own survey, with its price beside it"},{"tap":"#c-site .ly[data-k=cut]","say":"Every layer switches on and off"},{"tap":"#t-film","say":"Twenty stills and the circuit for the film"}]},{"n":7,"slug":"southpaw","kind":"site","lane":"loud","trade":"Boxing club","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Loud","name":"Southpaw","biz":"Boxing club, Leeds","c":"#E5232E","sheet":"#FBE0E2","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#E5232E","short":"Ring the bell on the club clock, then book a free first session from the timetable.","long":"The club clock is the centrepiece: ring the bell and a real round runs, three minutes in red, a minute's rest, twelve rounds with the bell. Below it the week is printed like a poster; tap any class and it becomes your free first session, booked with a name and a mobile.","proves":"Somebody who has never boxed can pick a level, pick a night this week and be booked in about twenty seconds.","tags":["A round timer you can train to","The week printed as a poster","A free first session in two fields"],"tk":"gym","show":[{"tap":"#startBtn","say":"Ring the bell: a real three-minute round starts","pause":2200},{"scroll":"#week","say":"The week as a poster. Tap a class to book it"},{"tap":"button[data-level=kids]","say":"For my kid: this week’s kids’ sessions"},{"scroll":"#dues","say":"Prices on the wall"}]},{"n":8,"slug":"marrow-and-pin","kind":"site","lane":"loud","trade":"Tattoo studio","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Loud","name":"Marrow & Pin","biz":"Tattoo studio, Bristol","c":"#F0386B","sheet":"#FDE3EA","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#DA3463","short":"The flash wall turns each stencil into healed skin, and one tap asks for that piece.","long":"The flash wall hangs nine stencils like plates in an artist's book: hover or tap one and the skin comes up, the ink runs down and the stencil goes with it. Pin a piece and “Ask for this piece” fills in the enquiry with the artist, size and idea. Then the three residents in type with their next free week, how booking works, aftercare in five lines and a short form.","proves":"Your own drawings can be the website, and they can still take the booking.","tags":["Plates from the artist's book","A flash wall that heals into skin","Ask for a piece and the enquiry fills itself in"],"tk":"tattoo","show":[{"scroll":"#flash","say":"The flash wall: nine stencils, each tattooed once"},{"tap":"#wall .plate[data-i=\"0\"]","say":"Tap one and it heals into skin"},{"tap":"#askBtn","say":"Ask for this piece: the enquiry fills itself in"}]},{"n":9,"slug":"hale-and-partners","kind":"site","lane":"quiet","trade":"Accountant","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Quiet","name":"Hale & Partners","biz":"Chartered accountants, Harrogate","c":"#12B76A","sheet":"#DEF5EA","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#137F4D","short":"An accountant's site that counts down your tax deadlines from today and quotes a fixed fee.","long":"Hale & Partners reads like an annual report written for the client. The year ahead is a large calendar counted from today: pick what you are and your dates turn green, tap one and the big figure counts down. Fixed fees, a finished set of accounts and a fee request follow.","proves":"The dates and the figures do the selling. Nothing else has to.","tags":["The year ahead counted from today","Your dates only, by what you are","Three fixed fees in plain columns"],"tk":"accountant","show":[{"tap":".who button[data-who=ltd]","say":"Pick what you are and your dates turn green"},{"tap":".cal .dl[data-k=ct]","say":"Tap any date and the count starts from today"},{"scroll":"#sheet","say":"A finished set of accounts, settling into this year"}]},{"n":10,"slug":"fern-physio","kind":"site","lane":"quiet","trade":"Physiotherapy clinic","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Quiet","name":"Fern Physio","biz":"Fern Physio","c":"#8EE6C4","sheet":"#EFFCF7","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#4E7869","short":"A calm clinic site where patients tap where it hurts and book the next free slot.","long":"Fern Physio opens on a bright treatment room and lets patients show where it hurts on a drawn body. Tap a knee or shoulder to see what that usually is, with the next three free slots one tap from booked. The first visit minute by minute, prices and the two physios follow.","proves":"A visitor can say where it hurts before they have to say anything to a receptionist.","tags":["A bright treatment room, not a stock smile","Tap where it hurts on a drawn body","The next three free slots beside the answer"],"tk":"clinic","show":[{"tap":".hot[data-r=shoulder]","say":"Tap where it hurts"},{"scroll":"#panel .slots","say":"The next free slots sit right beside it"},{"tap":"#panel .slot","say":"One tap and it is waiting in the booking"}]},{"n":11,"slug":"kestrel-electrical","kind":"site","lane":"direct","trade":"Electrician","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Direct","name":"Kestrel Electrical","biz":"Two-van electrical firm","c":"#C8F031","sheet":"#F7FDE2","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#6A7D23","short":"An electrician's site where every job is a breaker you can switch on.","long":"A photo-led first screen with the number at poster size and a 24-hour line that answers. Below it, the services are a real consumer unit: switch a breaker on and it shows what is included, the price and a button to ring. Then the price list, a review over a real job, the emergency line, a postcode check and a written-quote form.","proves":"Someone with the power off can ring the right number in one tap, at any hour, and know the price before they do.","tags":["Consumer unit services","Price list","Postcode check","24-hour number switching"],"tk":"electrician","show":[{"tap":"button[data-c=\"2\"]","say":"Flip a breaker for that job"},{"scroll":"#det","say":"Its price, how long it takes and who does it"},{"tap":"button[data-c=\"6\"]","say":"The emergency one puts the 24-hour number up"}]},{"n":12,"slug":"kerb-and-camber","kind":"site","lane":"direct","trade":"Garage","mobile":true,"group":"Websites · Direct","name":"Kerb & Camber","biz":"Kerb & Camber MOT Centre","c":"#F6C700","sheet":"#FEF7DB","cInk":"#141416","cText":"#8C730A","short":"Type your reg into a real number plate and the MOT date and next free slots come back.","long":"The hero is a UK number plate set into the workshop photo: type the reg, press Check, and the headline turns into the answer, \"MOT due in 247 days.\", with the next three free half-hours under it. Tap one and the booking sheet is already filled in: MOT, the day, the time and the reg. Below it a pinned job card walks a real MOT from 08:30 to 09:40, then the price board as it hangs by the office door.","proves":"Somebody who does not know when their MOT is due can find out and book it before they close the tab.","tags":["A real number plate you type into","The headline answers with your MOT date","The price board as it hangs in the office"],"tk":"garage","show":[{"type":"#reg","text":"KX19 LBD","say":"Put your reg in on the plate"},{"tap":"#checkBtn","say":"The headline answers: when the MOT is due"},{"tap":"#nextRow .slot-btn","say":"Take the next free half-hour: the booking is filled in"},{"scroll":"#prices","say":"The price board, with Book on every line"}]},{"n":13,"slug":"system","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"The system","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"One screen: every call caught, every job booked, and what still needs you.","long":"The app a service business runs on, shown for six made-up businesses. Today puts the whole day on one board in the business’s own colour: every missed call caught, every booking made and every quote won since the morning, and the work it added up to. It replays the morning in a few seconds, and new enquiries and bookings keep landing while you watch. Switch business from the menu and it all reloads for that trade.","proves":"The admin happens while you are on the tools.","tags":["Six businesses","Live from the clock","Every part connected"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#tdPlay","say":"Replay the morning","pause":300},{"wait":7500,"say":"Every call caught and every job booked, as it happened"},{"wait":8500,"say":"New work keeps landing while you watch"},{"tap":"#todaySim","say":"Try a missed call yourself","pause":400},{"wait":6500,"say":"It texts them back in seconds"}]},{"n":14,"slug":"inbox","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Inbox and missed calls","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Every call, text and form in one list. Missed calls get a text back in seconds.","long":"Press “Simulate a missed call” and watch it happen: the phone rings out, a countdown runs, the text goes from the business’s own number, and the customer replies. One tap sends the booking link, and the booking lands in the diary with its deposit.","proves":"The customer gets a text before they ring the next name on Google.","tags":["Missed-call text-back","One inbox","Booking link"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#simCall","say":"Simulate a missed call","pause":400},{"wait":7000,"say":"A text goes back in seconds, from the business’s own number"},{"wait":4500,"say":"They reply"},{"tap":"#inLink","say":"One tap sends the booking link","pause":400},{"wait":5500,"say":"They book and pay the deposit"}]},{"n":15,"slug":"booking","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Booking and the diary","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Customers book a real free time and pay a deposit. It lands in the right diary.","long":"A diary with a lane for each person, travel time between jobs, and the deposit on every online booking. Book as a customer from their phone and watch the slot appear; move a job, send an on-my-way text, or mark it done and the review ask queues itself.","proves":"Nobody books and vanishes, and nobody plays phone tag for a time.","tags":["Online booking","Deposits","Team diary"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#bkTry","say":"Book online, as a customer would"},{"tap":".bk-po","say":"Pick the job","pause":600},{"tap":"#bkT-0","say":"Pick a free time","pause":600},{"tap":"#bkPay","say":"Pay the deposit","pause":1200},{"tap":"#bkDone","say":"It is in the diary, marked new"}]},{"n":16,"slug":"quotes","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Quotes that chase themselves","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Quotes from your price list that chase themselves until the customer answers.","long":"Quotes built from the business’s own price list with VAT and a deposit. Send one and watch it get opened; it chases at 9am on day two and day five until the customer answers, then stops the moment they accept and pay the deposit.","proves":"Fewer quotes go cold while you are busy.","tags":["Price list","Automatic chasing","Accept and pay"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#qNew","say":"Start a quote from your own template"},{"tap":"#qSend","say":"Send it: the customer gets a link","pause":400},{"wait":4500,"say":"Opened, and the chasing is booked in"},{"tap":"#qPhone","say":"What the customer sees"},{"tap":"#qAccept","say":"They accept and pay the deposit. The chasing stops."}]},{"n":17,"slug":"reviews","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Google reviews","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Every finished job asks for a review. Replies take one tap.","long":"After each job the customer gets a short text with a link to leave a Google review. Every customer is asked, not only the happy ones, because Google’s rules ban picking. New reviews land here with a reply already written to edit and post.","proves":"More reviews, and recent ones, keep you near the top of the map.","tags":["Review asks","One-tap replies","Rating over time"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#rvSend","say":"Every finished job gets a review text","pause":400},{"wait":6500,"say":"A new five-star review lands"},{"tap":"#rvList [data-act=reply]","say":"The reply is drafted with their name and the job"},{"tap":"#rvPost","say":"Post it"}]},{"n":18,"slug":"reminders","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Reminders that rebook","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Yearly services, MOTs and regular cuts remind the customer and book themselves.","long":"Repeat work comes round on its own: the boiler service, the MOT, the six-weekly cut. The customer gets a reminder before it is due and books from the link; the booking drops into the diary without a phone call.","proves":"Last year’s customers come back before they search.","tags":["Due dates","Reminder texts","Rebooked jobs"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#rmSend","say":"Reminders go out before the work is due","pause":400},{"wait":5500,"say":"Customers book themselves in from the text"},{"tap":"#rmList .rm-row","say":"Each one: the text, its history and the free times"}]},{"n":19,"slug":"results","kind":"tool","lane":"system","trade":"Any service business","mobile":true,"group":"The system","name":"Results and ads","biz":"Six made-up service businesses","c":"#2563EB","sheet":"#E0E9FC","cInk":"#FFFFFF","cText":"#2563EB","short":"Where every job came from, what it was worth, and what the ads cost per job.","long":"A month-by-month view of where the work came from: Google Ads, Meta ads, the map, the website, referrals and repeat customers, with enquiries, bookings, the money booked and the cost per job. The monthly report writes itself in plain English. Demo figures for a made-up business.","proves":"You can see which pound of ad spend booked which job.","tags":["By source","Cost per job","Monthly report"],"tk":"any","show":[{"tap":"#rsMonth [data-i=\"4\"]","say":"Pick a month"},{"scroll":"#rsChain","say":"From enquiry to booked work"},{"tap":"#rsReport","say":"The monthly report, in plain English"}]}];